    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfea Shop Management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manually stock shelves, set competitive prices, and customize your store layout to attract more customers and maximize profits. Build your dream retail empire from the ground up.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/0473b1d12024dbbebaa4960f68f325b4.poster.avif?t=1754909771\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/0473b1d12024dbbebaa4960f68f325b4.webm?t=1754909771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/0473b1d12024dbbebaa4960f68f325b4.mp4?t=1754909771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/8be6f14c2d105b0d3207699977fe17ca.poster.avif?t=1754909771\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/8be6f14c2d105b0d3207699977fe17ca.webm?t=1754909771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/8be6f14c2d105b0d3207699977fe17ca.mp4?t=1754909771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude9a Open World Logistics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the city by foot or vehicle. Visit suppliers across the city, negotiate deals, and transport goods back to your store. Every delivery counts!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/c16be5b2476ac7df8c2d6524ec9cd1f3.poster.avif?t=1754909771\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/c16be5b2476ac7df8c2d6524ec9cd1f3.webm?t=1754909771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/c16be5b2476ac7df8c2d6524ec9cd1f3.mp4?t=1754909771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcdc Licenses &amp; Permits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock business licenses to sell advanced weapons and rare items. Expand your legal inventory and take your shop to the next level.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/d616fb89d07c60411096649c47812ef8.poster.avif?t=1754909771\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/d616fb89d07c60411096649c47812ef8.webm?t=1754909771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/d616fb89d07c60411096649c47812ef8.mp4?t=1754909771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcc5 Weekly Economy System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your finances like a real entrepreneur. Pay utility bills, track expenses, and make strategic decisions to keep your business afloat in a shifting economy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/7ab2e17267b9d541c58cd108e1d79b03.poster.avif?t=1754909771\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/7ab2e17267b9d541c58cd108e1d79b03.webm?t=1754909771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/7ab2e17267b9d541c58cd108e1d79b03.mp4?t=1754909771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb0 Casino &amp; Gambling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from business and test your luck at the local casino. Bet your hard-earned money\u2014win big or lose it all in seconds.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/91ada338c88819ee204183dca2479841.poster.avif?t=1754909771\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/91ada338c88819ee204183dca2479841.webm?t=1754909771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/91ada338c88819ee204183dca2479841.mp4?t=1754909771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2b50 Reputation &amp; Cleanliness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your shop clean and your streets tidy to improve customer satisfaction. A well-maintained store boosts your reputation and attracts more foot traffic.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/dfda20e3f27a603b0256e1facb02f584.poster.avif?t=1754909771\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/dfda20e3f27a603b0256e1facb02f584.webm?t=1754909771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/dfda20e3f27a603b0256e1facb02f584.mp4?t=1754909771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f Theft &amp; Security</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay vigilant against thieves. Protect your inventory and keep your business secure from criminal activity.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/b6c9f9672049e3c9bfabd8471efd711e.poster.avif?t=1754909771\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/b6c9f9672049e3c9bfabd8471efd711e.webm?t=1754909771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/b6c9f9672049e3c9bfabd8471efd711e.mp4?t=1754909771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
